#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:2
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:4
msgid ""
"Plugins are optional extensions that add native Studio capabilities or "
"connect to the Harness runtime. Manage them from **Settings > Plugins**. "
"A plugin is separate from the Godot Bridge plugin managed on the **Godot "
"Projects** page."
msgstr "插件是可选扩展，可添加 Studio 原生能力或连接 Harness 运行时。请从 **Settings > Plugins** 管理插件。插件与 **Godot Projects** 页面管理的 Godot Bridge 插件相互独立。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:9
msgid "Plugin catalog"
msgstr "插件目录"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select a plugin to inspect its details before installing or enabling it. "
"The detail view can show:"
msgstr "在安装或启用插件前，选择插件查看其详细信息。详细视图可以显示："

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:14
msgid "features and changelog information;"
msgstr "功能和变更日志信息；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:15
msgid "compatibility classification and compatibility notes;"
msgstr "兼容性分类和兼容性说明；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:16
msgid "declared entry points and capabilities;"
msgstr "声明的入口点和能力；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:17
msgid "trust state and package fingerprint;"
msgstr "信任状态和软件包指纹；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:18
msgid "the native or Harness runtime it uses; and"
msgstr "它使用的原生运行时或 Harness 运行时；以及"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:19
msgid "runtime logs and an explanation of what the plugin can change."
msgstr "运行时日志，以及插件可以更改哪些内容的说明。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:21
msgid ""
"Compatibility classifications include **Daedalus Native**, **Harness "
"Bundle**, **Harness Client**, **Daedalus + Harness**, **Metadata only**, "
"and **Unsupported**. An unsupported package cannot run in the current "
"Studio runtime."
msgstr "兼容性分类包括 **Daedalus Native**、**Harness Bundle**、**Harness Client**、**Daedalus + Harness**、**Metadata only** 和 **Unsupported**。不受支持的软件包无法在当前 Studio 运行时中运行。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:27
msgid "Install or update a plugin"
msgstr "安装或更新插件"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:29
msgid "Select **Add plugin** and choose a supported source:"
msgstr "选择 **Add plugin**，然后选择受支持的来源："

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:31
msgid "a local folder;"
msgstr "本地文件夹；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:32
msgid "a ``.tgz`` tarball;"
msgstr "``.tgz`` 压缩包；"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:33
msgid "an npm package; or"
msgstr "npm 软件包；或"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:34
msgid "a Git repository."
msgstr "Git 仓库。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:36
msgid ""
"Provide an exact version, repository URL, or commit SHA when the selected"
" source requires it. During installation, Studio copies the package, "
"calculates its hash, and statically inspects it. Installation scripts and"
" plugin code are not executed as part of this inspection."
msgstr "如果选定的来源需要，请提供准确版本、仓库 URL 或提交 SHA。安装过程中，Studio 会复制软件包、计算其哈希并进行静态检查。安装脚本和插件代码不会在此检查过程中执行。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:41
msgid ""
"Use **Update plugin** from the plugin details when a newer package is "
"available. Studio keeps previous versions so that you can review or roll "
"back when necessary."
msgstr "有更新的软件包时，请从插件详情中使用 **Update plugin**。Studio 会保留旧版本，方便你在必要时检查或回滚。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:46
msgid "Trust and enable a plugin"
msgstr "信任并启用插件"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:48
msgid ""
"A plugin can be **Trusted**, **Review required**, or **Disabled**. Before"
" trusting it, review the README, compatibility notes, declared "
"capabilities, source, and fingerprint. A plugin that requires review "
"cannot be enabled until you explicitly trust it."
msgstr "插件可以处于 **Trusted**、**Review required** 或 **Disabled** 状态。信任前，请检查 README、兼容性说明、声明的能力、来源和指纹。需要审查的插件必须在你明确信任后才能启用。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:53
msgid ""
"Trust is not blanket permission. Tool policy and approval still control "
"actual calls. Enable or disable the plugin for the active profile from "
"its details view. Trusted plugins start when one of their capabilities is"
" first used."
msgstr "信任不是无条件授权。工具策略和审批仍然控制实际调用。请从详情视图为活动配置文件启用或禁用插件。受信任的插件会在其某项能力第一次被使用时启动。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:58
msgid "Runtime maintenance"
msgstr "运行时维护"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:60
msgid ""
"The plugin details view provides actions for starting or disabling a "
"runtime, restarting it, and inspecting runtime logs. If a plugin is "
"quarantined, use **Clear quarantine and retry** only after addressing the"
" reported failure. **Previous versions** and **Rollback** help return to "
"a known version."
msgstr "插件详情视图提供启动或禁用运行时、重启运行时以及检查运行时日志的操作。如果插件被隔离，请先处理报告的故障，再使用 **Clear quarantine and retry**。**Previous versions** 和 **Rollback** 可帮助你恢复到已知版本。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:65
msgid ""
"Installing plugin dependencies can require explicit network confirmation."
" Check the dependency source and expected changes before allowing network"
" access. For Harness Bundle plugins, the preview action lets you inspect "
"the bundle before using it."
msgstr "安装插件依赖可能需要明确确认网络访问。允许网络访问前，请检查依赖来源和预期变更。对于 Harness Bundle 插件，预览操作可以让你在使用前检查软件包。"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:71
msgid "Remove a plugin"
msgstr "移除插件"

#: ../../source/settings/plugins.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Remove** deletes the plugin package from Daedalus-managed storage. This"
" is different from disabling a plugin: disabling keeps the package "
"installed but excludes it from the active profile. Remove a package only "
"when you no longer need it or have another copy available."
msgstr "**Remove** 会从 Daedalus 管理的存储中删除插件软件包。这与禁用插件不同：禁用会保留已安装的软件包，但将其排除在活动配置文件之外。只有在不再需要软件包或已有其他副本时才移除它。"
